  "step_3": "The information relevant to the decision reason — the sum of absolute pairwise differences in outcomes — is not considered by the individual. Instead, the individual focuses exclusively on the probability of winning (50% vs. 25%), ignoring the actual monetary differences between outcomes. The decision reason requires evaluating the sum of pairwise outcome differences, which is absent from the verbal report. The individual’s justification is based on probability, not on outcome differences. Therefore, the decision reason was not used. The individual did not compute or refer to any pairwise differences in outcomes or their sum. This indicates a clear lack of use of the specified reason.",
